+---
+title: Rules
+description: Exec policy rules for command approval decisions.
+---
+
+Rules let you classify shell commands before they run. They are useful for
+team-level command policy, especially in automation.
+
+Use the existing [Exec policy](/docs/execpolicy) reference for rule syntax and
+checking commands locally.
+
+Rules complement sandboxing. They do not replace filesystem and network
+boundaries.
